@startuml
' What: the end-of-game Mirror (D-53).
' Shows: three end triggers, the six layers of the portrait, and the two outputs:
'        a short in-game portrait (patterns only) and a profile export for the player's own LLM.
' Source: brainstorming-base.md, D-29, D-31 ... D-35, D-49, D-53, Q-49.
title The Mirror at the end of a game
start
split
  :Unciv end condition\n(victory type or defeat);
  note right: VictoryScreen,\noneMoreTurnMode
split again
  :Retire button;
split again
  :Player asks for the Mirror;
  note right: ends the game?\nQ-49
end split
:Freeze the soul history\n(all generations);
:Build the six layers;
note right
  temperament, ego path,
  temptation vs. flexibility,
  agency, path in Q6,
  words vs. deeds
end note
split
  :In-game portrait\n(patterns, no numbers,\nno keyword-to-family map);
split again
  :Profile export\n(advisor kit, D-29);
  :Player's own LLM\nwrites the analysis;
end split
stop
@enduml
